<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!-- HSK/CE patch: strip the Grappling Hook ability from Privateer Armor.

     The ability teleports the wearer 20 cells through walls/solid rock which
     interacts badly with Combat Extended's line-of-sight, range, and movement
     systems (can break suppression, ignore CE's cover pathing, etc.).

     Privateer Armor (VFEP_Apparel_Privateer) remains fully craftable and
     functional — it just loses the shoulder-mounted grappling hook module.
     Enemy pirates wearing Privateer Armor also lose grappling, preventing
     raid AI from mis-using it against player defenses.

     Gated inside Patches-CE/ via LoadFolders.xml so this only activates when
     CE is loaded. Vanilla / non-CE installs keep the grappling hook intact. -->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationRemove">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="VFEP_Apparel_Privateer"]/comps/li[@Class="VFECore.Abilities.CompProperties_AbilitiesApparel"]</xpath>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
